*> Helpers of the Nether, End and boss mob tests (lane 002-lane-mobsfull-h12; COPY after the test program and after MOBSPTEST.cpy; touch the test after changing it).
*>   TEST-CHK USING case (PIC X(100)), expected, observed (BINARY-LONG): one numeric assertion.
*>   TEST-TYPE USING key (PIC X(24)), type id out, species row out: the entity type id and the STDMOBS.cpy row of minecraft:<key>.
*>   TEST-FLOOR-HERE USING dim, x, y, z (BINARY-LONG): a stone block at that cell (the mob stands above it).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-CHK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-CASE                 PIC X(100).
 01 L-EXPECTED             BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-OBSERVED             BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-CASE L-EXPECTED L-OBSERVED.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE L-CASE TO TL-CASE
     MOVE L-EXPECTED TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE L-OBSERVED TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-CHK.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-TYPE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CONTENT.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-NAME                 PIC X(24).
 01 L-TYPE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-ROW                  BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-NAME L-TYPE L-ROW.
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     STRING "minecraft:" DELIMITED BY SIZE L-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY L-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     CALL "STDMOB-INDEX" USING L-TYPE L-ROW
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-TYPE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-FLOOR-HERE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112) VALUE "minecraft:stone".
 01 WS-STATE               BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-DIM                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-X                    BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-Y                    BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-Z                    BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-DIM L-X L-Y L-Z.
     CALL "MS-TEST-STATE" USING WS-KEY WS-STATE
     CALL "WORLD-SET-BLOCK" USING L-DIM L-X L-Y L-Z WS-STATE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM TEST-FLOOR-HERE.
